    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1456">

                <pb facs="1110" n="994" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg994"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/152.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Carothers
                        to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 15, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Have just received telegram from Díaz Lombardo at Chihuahua repeating message he
                    received from Guadalajara relative Jalisco State tax on foreigners as follows:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Nothing definite has been decided owing to absence of Governor but no
                            energetic measures have been taken against any one. I will keep you
                            informed.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>This means that matter is still held in abeyance and I am sure that no action
                    will be taken to enforce payment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carothers.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
